sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as TrustyAI Operator<br/>(manager)
    participant TASCtrl as TAS Controller
    participant LMESCtrl as LMES Controller
    participant EvalHubCtrl as EvalHub Controller
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS Reencrypt
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant TASService as TrustyAI Service<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant DriverPod as Driver Container
    participant LMESJob as lmes-job Container
    participant TenantNS as Tenant Namespace

    Note over User,TASService: Flow 1: TrustyAIService Instance Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: Create TrustyAIService CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>TASCtrl: Watch event (TrustyAIService)
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment + kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Service, Route, PVC, ServiceMonitor<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Patch KServe InferenceService finalizers<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    User->>Route: Request to TrustyAI Service<br/>HTTPS TLS (reencrypt)
    Route->>RBACProxy: Forward request<br/>HTTPS TLS
    RBACProxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>RBACProxy: Auth result
    RBACProxy->>TASService: Proxied request<br/>HTTP (localhost)
    TASService-->>RBACProxy: Response
    RBACProxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User,LMESJob: Flow 2: LMEvalJob Execution

    User->>K8sAPI: Create LMEvalJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>LMESCtrl: Watch event (LMEvalJob)
    LMESCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Pod (driver + lmes-job containers)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    LMESCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PVC for evaluation data<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    DriverPod->>K8sAPI: pod/exec to lmes-job container<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    DriverPod->>LMESJob: Execute evaluation harness
    LMESJob-->>DriverPod: Evaluation results
    DriverPod->>K8sAPI: Update LMEvalJob status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over User,TenantNS: Flow 3: EvalHub Multi-Tenant Propagation

    User->>K8sAPI: Create EvalHub CR (multi-tenant mode)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>EvalHubCtrl: Watch event (EvalHub)
    EvalHubCtrl->>K8sAPI: List namespaces with tenant label<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    EvalHubCtrl->>TenantNS: Create ServiceAccount, RoleBinding<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    EvalHubCtrl->>TenantNS: Copy provider/collection ConfigMaps<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    EvalHubCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create MLflow Experiment resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    User->>RBACProxy: Request to EvalHub<br/>HTTPS 8443/TCP TLS
    RBACProxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>RBACProxy: Auth validated
